Package: mhwater
Title: Metropolis-Hastings Sampling with an Ontario Water-Quality
    Application
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Felix", "Mainville", , "fmainvil@uoguelph.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Matthew", "Kai Kai", , "mkaikai@uoguelph.ca", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Tools for the STAT*4000 Metropolis-Hastings project: a
    hand-written Metropolis-Hastings sampler, cleaning of Ontario
    Provincial (Stream) Water Quality Monitoring Network (PWQMN) total
    phosphorus data, and maximum-likelihood comparison of candidate
    distributions used as the sampler target.
